    what: "#919 (M7, D-M7-4): a zombie's melee damage ledger read back out of world/entities/r.0.0.mca after a 1.21.1 dedicated server (NeoForge 21.1.248, Forgeweave 1.0.0 release jar) saved it: the tag under the entity's neoforge:attachments \"forgeweave:damage_xp\" key, player UUID -> tool UUID -> damage. A ledger normally comes from a player's melee hit, which a player-less server can't make, so the values went in through `data merge entity` (1.21.1's own attachment deserializer) and the server's save wrote them back out. 380df991-... is the offline-mode UUID of a player named Dev and 0bcd6e74-... is m7_tool_level.snbt's forgeweave:tool_id. Never regenerate."
}
